1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,000
用格路解讀原卷兩邊嘅和。每條路都由左下去右上。
Read both sums as paths from the bottom left to the top right.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:29,000
如果有 n−j 個斜步，向右同向上各要 j 步。
With n − j diagonals, there are j east steps and j north steps.

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:47,000
先揀向右嘅位置，再喺剩低 n 格揀向上嘅位置。
Choose positions for E, then place N in j of the n remaining slots.

4
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:06,000
將每個斜步拆成先向右、後向上，標記中間嘅拐角。
Expand a diagonal into east then north, and mark the corner.

5
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:24,000
展開後只剩向右同向上嘅步。拐角可以各自標記。
The expanded path uses only E and N. Each corner can be marked.

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:42,000
反過來，將畫咗記號嘅 EN 壓回斜步，就還原原路。
Compress each marked EN back to a diagonal to recover the path.

7
00:01:42,000 --> 00:02:03,000
比較拐角位置。每行向右再向上，令兩組座標嚴格遞增。
At successive EN corners both coordinates strictly increase.

8
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:21,000
反過來，按座標順序先向上再向右，逐個接返拐角。
Given the ordered coordinates, go north then east to each corner.

9
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:31,000
最後先上到頂，有餘下路程先向右，所以冇新增 EN 拐角。
Go north to the top, then east as needed. No extra EN corner is added.

10
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:49,000
k 個拐角各自可以標記或唔標記，共有 2ᵏ 種。
Each of the k corners can be marked or unmarked, giving 2ᵏ choices.

11
00:02:49,000 --> 00:03:10,000
兩種點法數嘅係同一批格路，所以兩邊相等。
The two counts describe the same paths, so the sums are equal.
